"trying to run as root.  Error %1 %2"
msgstr ""
"Ni môsz dosc prawa, abë zatrzëmac nen proces, króm tegò pòkôza sã téż fela "
"przë próbie dzejaniô jakno sprôwnik. Fela %1 %2"

#: ksysguardprocesslist.cpp:1028 ksysguardprocesslist.cpp:1240
msgid "You must select a process first."
msgstr "Je nót wprzód wëbrac proces"

#: ksysguardprocesslist.cpp:1105
msgid ""
"You do not have sufficient privileges to change the CPU scheduler. Aborting."
msgstr "Ni môsz dosc prawa bë zmienic planowanié CPU. Dzéjanié òprzestóné."

#: ksysguardprocesslist.cpp:1113
msgid ""
"You do not have sufficient privileges to change the CPU priority. Aborting."
msgstr "Ni môsz dosc prawa bë zmienic prioritet CPU. Dzéjanié òprzestóné."

#: ksysguardprocesslist.cpp:1119
msgid ""
"You do not have sufficient privileges to change the IO scheduler and "
"priority. Aborting."
msgstr ""
"Ni môsz dosc prawa bë zmienic planowanié ë prioritet IO. Dzéjanié òprzestóné."

#: ksysguardprocesslist.cpp:1154
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You do not have the permission to change the I/O priority of the process and "
"there was a problem trying to run as root.  Error %1 %2"
msgstr ""
"Ni môsz dosc prawa bë zmienic planowanié ë prioritet IO, króm tegò pòkôza  "
"sã fela przë zrëszaniu jakno sprôwnik. Fela %1 %2"

#: ksysguardprocesslist.cpp:1186
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You do not have the permission to change the CPU Scheduler for the process "
"and there was a problem trying to run as root.  Error %1 %2"
msgstr ""
"Ni môsz dosc prawa bë zmienic planowanié CPU, króm tegò pòkôza  sã fela przë "
"zrëszaniu jakno sprôwnik. Fela %1 %2"

#: ksysguardprocesslist.cpp:1216
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You do not have the permission to kill the process and there was a problem "
"trying to run as root.  Error %1 %2"
msgstr ""
"Ni môsz dosc prawa bë zakùńczëc nen proces, króm tegò pòkôza sã fela przë "
"zrëszaniu jakno sprôwnik. Fela %1 %2"

