"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Standardowé planowanié dlô "
"procesów bez òsoblëwich wëmògów.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:106
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioNormal)
#: rc.cpp:115 rc.cpp:364
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Normal Scheduling: Default Linux time-sharing  (Other)</span></"
"p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-weight:600;"
"\">Normal<span style=\" font-weight:400;\"> is the standard Linux time-"
"sharing scheduler that is intended for all processes that do not  require "
"special static priority real-time mechanisms. The process to run is chosen "
"from the list of other</span> Normal<span style=\" font-weight:400;\"> or </"
"span>Batch<span style=\" font-weight:400;\"> processes based on a dynamic "
"priority that is determined only inside this list. The dynamic priority is "
"based on the priority level given and increased for each time-quantum the "
"process is ready to run, but denied to run by the scheduler. This ensures "
"fair progress among all Normal processes.</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Zwëczajné planowanié: Domëslny w systemie Linux  (inne)</"
"span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-weight:600;\">Zwëczjané "
"planowanié<span style=\" font-weight:400;\"> to standardowé plaowanié z "
"dzeleniém czasu w Linuksie. Wëmëslóny dlô procesów, chtërny nie je nót "
"òpiartëch ò statuczné prioritetë mechanizmów realnegò czasu. Zrëszany proces "
"je wëbieróny z lëstë jinszëch procesów jakno </span> zwëczajnych<span style="
"\" font-weight:400;\"> abò </span>wsôdowich<span style=\" font-weight:400;"
"\"> na spòdlém dinamicznégò prioritetu blós z ti lëstë. Dinamiczny prioritet "
"je òpiarti ò pòdóné pòłożenié  prioritetu ë zwikszóny pò kòżdi pòjedińczoscë "
"czasu, jak proces bëł fardich do dzejaniô, rówank ni òstôł zrëszony przez "
"planowanié. To prowôdzy do  równych dzejaniów wszëtczich procesów "
"sparłãczonych z klasy zwëczajnych.</span> </p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:109
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioNormal)
#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:250
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioIONormal)
#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:109
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioNormal)
#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:250
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioIONormal)
#: rc.cpp:122 rc.cpp:189 rc.cpp:371 rc.cpp:438
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Zwëczajny"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:119
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, radioBatch)
#: rc.cpp:125 rc.cpp:374
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">For CPU-intensive non-"
"interactive processes.  Process is mildly disfavored in scheduling decisions."
"</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Dlô brëkùjących wiele "
"czasu procesora nieinteraktiwnych procesów. Przez planowanié ne procesë są "
"trzimóné kąsk gòrzi.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:126
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioBatch)
#: rc.cpp:131 rc.cpp:380
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Batch Scheduling</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-weight:600;\"><span "
"style=\" font-weight:400; font-style:italic;\">(Since Linux 2.6.16.)</"
"span><span style=\" font-weight:400;\"> This policy is similar to </"
"span>Normal<span style=\" font-weight:400;\">, except that this policy will "
"cause the scheduler to always assume that the process is CPU-intensive.  "
"Consequently, the scheduler will apply a small scheduling penalty so that "
"this process is mildly disfavored in scheduling decisions. This policy is "
"useful for workloads that are non-interactive, but do not want to lower "
"their nice value, and for workloads that want a deterministic scheduling "
"policy without interactivity causing extra preemptions (between the "
"workload's tasks).</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Wsôdowé planowanié</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-weight:600;\"><span "
"style=\" font-weight:400; font-style:italic;\">(Òd Linuksa 2.6.16.)</"
"span><span style=\" font-weight:400;\"> Na pòlitika schlachùje za </"
"span>zwëczajną<span style=\" font-weight:400;\">,równak na doprowôdzô do  "
"tegò, że planowanié zakłôdô wiôldżé brëkòwanié procesora przez proces. Przez "
"to nałożi niewiôlgą sztrafã, chtërnô dô kąsk gòrszé achtniãcé taczegò "
"procesu. Na pòlitika je brëkòwnô dlô karnów nieinteraktiwnych dzejaniôw, "
"chtërné równak ni chcą zmniészëc prioritetu (wôrtnotë nice), a téż dlô  "
"dzejaniów brëkùjących deterministicznegò dzejaniô planowaniô bez  "
"interaktiwnotë prowôdzący do dodôwné sparłãczenia (midzy dzejaniama "
"przënôlegającyma do karna).</span></p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:129
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioBatch)
#: rc.cpp:138 rc.cpp:387
msgid "Batch"
msgstr "Wsôdowi"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:139
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, radioRR)
#: rc.cpp:141 rc.cpp:390
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Process will run whenever "
"runnable.  Higher priority than Normal or Batch.  Has Timeslicing.</p></"
"body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Procesë bãdą robic jak  to "
"bãdze blós mòżlëwé. Wëższi prioritet jak w karnie zwëczajnych abò wsadowich, "
"Je pòdzelënk czasu (timeslicing).</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:146
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioRR)
#: rc.cpp:147 rc.cpp:396
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Round Robin Scheduling</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Round Robin</span> is a simple enhancement of <span style=\" "
"font-weight:600;\">FIFO</span>.  Everything described below for <span style="
"\" font-weight:600;\">FIFO</span> also applies to <span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Round Robin</span>, except that each process is only allowed "
"to run for a maximum time quantum.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Rotacjowé planowanié</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Rotacjowé planowanié (Round Robin)</span> je prostim "
"rozszérzeniém <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">FIFO</span>.  Wszëtkò co "
"stoi niżi na témã <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">FIFO</span> trôfiô téż w "
"przëtrôfkù <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">rotacjowégò</span>  planowania, "
"le kòżdi proces mòże robic blós przez maksymalno kwant czasu.</p></body></"
"html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:149
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioRR)
#: rc.cpp:154 rc.cpp:403
msgid "Round robin"
msgstr "Rotacjowi (Round Robin)"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:159
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, radioFIFO)
#: rc.cpp:157 rc.cpp:406
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Process will run whenever "
"runnable.  Higher priority than Normal or Batch.  No timeslicing.</p></"
"body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Procesë bãdą robic jak to "
"le mòżlëwé.  Wëższi prioritet jak w karnie zwëczajnych ë wsôdowich.  To nie "
"dô pòdzelënkù czasu (timeslicing).</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:166
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioFIFO)
#: rc.cpp:163 rc.cpp:412
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">First In-First Out Scheduling</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">When  a  <span style=\" "
"font-weight:600;\">FIFO</span> process  becomes  runnable,  it  will always "
"immediately preempt any currently running <span style=\" font-weight:600;"
"\">Normal</span> or <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Batch</span> process.</"
"p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Pòsobnica FIFO</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Jak proces <span style=\" "
"font-weight:600;\">FIFO</span> mòże robic, wiedno przeriwô robòtã aktualnegò "
"procesu z klasë <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">zwëczajnych</span> ë <span "
"style=\" font-weight:600;\">wsôdowich</span>.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:169
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioFIFO)
#: rc.cpp:170 rc.cpp:419
msgid "FIFO"
msgstr "FIFO"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:227
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_3)
#: rc.cpp:173 rc.cpp:422
msgid "I/O Scheduler"
msgstr "Planowanié I/O"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:240
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, radioIONormal)
#: rc.cpp:176 rc.cpp:425
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Process's priority is "
"based on the CPU priority.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Prioritetë procesów są "
"òpiarté ò prioritetë procesora.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:247
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioIONormal)
#: rc.cpp:182 rc.cpp:431
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Normal Scheduling</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">This is the same as <span "
"style=\" font-weight:600;\">Best Effort</span> scheduling, except that the "
"priority is calculated automatically based on the CPU priority.  Processes "
"with a higher priority will take priority for access to the hard disk.  "
"Programs running at the same <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Best Effort/"
"Normal</span> priority are served in a <span style=\" font-weight:600;"
"\">Round Robin</span> fashion.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Zwëczajné planowanié</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Je to dzejanié równé "
"planowaniô <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">jak nôlepi</span>, króm tegò, "
"że prioritet je òbrëchòwóny aùtomatno na spòdlém prioritetu procesora.  "
"Procesë o wëższim prioritece bãdą miec pierszosc w przëstãpie do diskù. "
"Programë z klasów <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">jak nôlepi/zwëczajno</"
"span> ò równym prioritece są zortowóné z pòmòcą <span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">rotacjowégò</span> algòritmù.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:260
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, radioIdle)
#: rc.cpp:192 rc.cpp:441
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Process can only use the "
"hard disk when no other process has used it very recently.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Proces mòże ùżëwac diskù "
"blós jeżlë niżóden jinszi proces gò slédno ni brëkòwôł.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:267
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioIdle)
#: rc.cpp:198 rc.cpp:447
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Idle Scheduling</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">A  program running with "
"<span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Idle</span> I/O priority will only get "
"disk time when no other program has asked for disk I/O for a defined grace "
"period. The impact of <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Idle</span> I/O "
"processes on normal system activity should be zero. Priority is not "
"applicable to this scheduling class.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Nierobné planowanié</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Programa robiącô z <span "
"style=\" font-weight:600;\">nierobnym</span> prioritetã I/O dostôwô przëstãp "
"do diskù blós jak jinszô progama ni brëkòwô taczégò przëstãpù  przez gwësny "
"czas. Cësk <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">nierobnych</span> procesów  na "
"zwëczajną robòtã systemë mùszi bëc równy zero. W przëtrôfkù ti klasë "
"prioritetë są niewôżné.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:270
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioIdle)
#: rc.cpp:205 rc.cpp:454
msgid "Idle"
msgstr "Nierobny"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:280
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, radioBestEffort)
#: rc.cpp:208 rc.cpp:457
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Process is given higher "
"priority to access the hard disk than Normal.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Proces mô wëższi prioritet "
"w przëstãpie do diskù jak proces z karna zwëczajnych.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:287
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioBestEffort)
#: rc.cpp:214 rc.cpp:463
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Best Effort Scheduling</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Processes with a higher "
"priority will take priority for access to the hard disk.  Programs running "
"at the same <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Best Effort/Normal</span> "
"priority are served in a <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Round Robin</"
"span> fashion.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Planowanié: jak nôlepi</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Procesë z wëższim "
"prioritetã mają pierszeznã w przëstãpie do diskù. Programë z klasów <span "
"style=\" font-weight:600;\">jak nôlepi/zwëczajno</span> robiacé z równym "
"prioritetã są òbsłëgiwóné <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">rotacjową (Round "
"Robin)</span> metodą.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:290
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioBestEffort)
#: rc.cpp:221 rc.cpp:470
msgid "Best effort"
msgstr "Jak nôlepi (best effort)"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:300
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, radioRealTime)
#: rc.cpp:224 rc.cpp:473
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Process gets immediate "
"access to the hard disk whenever needed, regardless of what else is going on."
"</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Proces dobiwô zarô "
"przëstãpù do diskù, niezanôléżno ò tegò, co je lós.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:307
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioRealTime)
#: rc.cpp:230 rc.cpp:479
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Real Time Scheduling</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">The <span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Real Time</span> scheduling class is given first access to the "
"disk, regardless of what else is going on in the system. Thus the <span "
"style=\" font-weight:600;\">Real Time</span> class needs to be used with "
"some care, as it can starve other processes. As with the <span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Best Effort</span> class, 8 priority levels are defined "
"denoting how big a time slice a given process will receive on each "
"scheduling window.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">Realnoczasowé planowanié</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Klasa <span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">realnoczasowô</span> dobiwô przëstãp do diskù jakno pierszô, "
"niezanôleżno od jinszëch dzejaniów w systemie. Przez to, <span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">realnoczasowô</span>klasa mùszi bëc brëkòwónô z głową, bò "
"jinszé procesë mògą òstac zagłodzoné. Tak jak w przëtrôfkù klasë <span style="
"\" font-weight:600;\">jak nôlepi</span>, je zdefiniowónych 8 légów "
"prioritetów miarë kwantów czasu przëznónych procesowi w kòżdim òknie "
"planowaniô.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:310
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioRealTime)
#: rc.cpp:237 rc.cpp:486
msgid "Real time"
msgstr "Realnoczasowé"

